-- Status: UNVERIFIED
MODULE [modus_ponens]

THEOREM [modus_ponens]:
  GIVEN:
    - [hPQ]: $P \to Q$
    - [hP]: $P$
  CLAIM:
    $Q$

PROOF OF [modus_ponens]:

  [1] HAVE $P \to Q$ available as a function from a proof of $P$ to a proof of $Q$.
      BY [hPQ], the given implication read as its introduction form.

  [2] HAVE a proof of $P$.
      BY [hP], the given hypothesis.

  [3] SHOW $Q$.
      BY [1], [2], applying the function of [1] to the argument of [2].

  QED BY [3].
